sequenceDiagram
    actor LLM as LLM / Agent
    participant Router as Tool Router
    participant Validator as Schema Validator & Repair Engine
    participant Resolver as DAG Dependency Resolver
    participant Pool as Execution Pool
    participant Registry as Tool Registry Catalog
    participant Aggregator as Result Aggregator

    LLM->>Router: Submit Tool Calls
    Router->>Validator: Validate Arguments

    alt Validation Failed
        Validator-->>Router: Validation Error
        Router-->>LLM: Return Error Result
    else Validation Succeeded
        Validator-->>Router: Validated Arguments
        Router->>Resolver: Build Execution Plan (DAG)
        Resolver-->>Router: Dependency Plan

        Router->>Pool: Execute Plan

        loop Parallel Execution
            Pool->>Registry: Lookup Tool
            Registry-->>Pool: Tool Definition
            Pool->>Pool: Execute Tool Handler

            alt Execution Failed
                Pool->>Pool: Retry logic (if configured)
            end
        end

        Pool-->>Aggregator: Collect Results
        Aggregator-->>Router: Synthesized Output
        Router-->>LLM: Return Tool Results
    end
